**Project:** Custom Ride-Hailing Platform (Native React Native Mobile Apps & Web Admin Suite)  
**Target Delivery:** Passenger Mobile App (iOS & Android) + Driver Partner Mobile App (iOS & Android) + Central Web Operations Dashboard  
**Prepared By:** Sales Cowboy Marketing Solutions (Enterprise Engineering Division)  
