## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

The objective of this engagement is to design, develop, deploy, and launch a complete enterprise on-demand ride-hailing and mobility ecosystem engineered for rapid dispatch, real-time driver tracking, and commercial fleet management.

The ecosystem is engineered across three native and web pillars:
1. **Passenger Mobile Application:** Built using **React Native** for native deployment on both **Apple iOS (App Store)** and **Google Android (Google Play Store)**, delivering high-speed booking, accurate fare calculation, and live GPS tracking.
2. **Driver Partner Mobile Application:** Built using **React Native** for **Apple iOS** and **Google Android**, providing drivers with instant ride requests, automated fare acceptance, turn-by-turn navigation, and in-app earnings wallets.
3. **Central Operations & Master Admin Web Dashboard:** A secure, high-performance web-based control tower built with **Next.js (React)** for fleet managers and business owners to monitor live dispatches on a map, configure dynamic tariffs, enforce KYC compliance, and audit revenue splits.

