## 2. SYSTEM MODULES & DELIVERABLES

### Module 1: Passenger Application (Native React Native: iOS & Android)
* **Onboarding & User Authentication:**
  * Fast mobile onboarding with SMS OTP phone verification (Termii integration).
  * Rider profile management and saved frequent address shortcuts (Home, Office, Airport, Favorites).
* **Ride Booking & Dynamic Fare Engine:**
  * Intuitive pickup and destination search powered by interactive map integration.
  * Real-time automated fare calculation based on baseline flag-fall, trip distance, and estimated travel duration.
  * Multi-tier ride selection: Standard (Sedan), Comfort (Air Conditioned), and Executive / XL.
* **Live Driver Matching & Geospatial Tracking:**
  * Proximity-based ride dispatch matching the passenger with the closest active online driver.
  * Real-time smooth vehicle icon movement on the interactive map with live Estimated Time of Arrival (ETA) countdown.
  * Complete driver and vehicle transparency: driver verified photo, full legal name, telephone contact button, vehicle make, model, color, and license plate number.
* **Safety & Trip Completion:**
  * **Start-of-Trip OTP Verification:** A secure 4-digit code generated for the rider that the driver must enter before the trip begins to ensure verified passenger pickup.
  * In-app call and direct messaging button connecting rider and driver without exposing personal phone numbers.
  * Real-time trip status progression (`Driver En Route`, `Driver Arrived`, `Trip in Progress`, `Arrived at Destination`).
  * Two-way rating and feedback system upon trip completion.
  * Automated digital trip receipts sent via email and in-app notification.

